<title>THAILAND: Nakornthon unaudited year net up 15 pct.</title>
<headline>Nakornthon unaudited year net up 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   1996		     1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 5.63	 vs	  5.45</p>
<p>    Net			701.57	 vs	610.79</p>
<p>Notes: Fourth quarter figures, revenue not available. Nakornthon is a commercial bank.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
